{"disposition": "Unaccounted", "excerpt": "$$\n\\text{Precision} = \\frac{TP}{TP + FP} \\quad \\text{(of predicted positives, how many are actually positive)}\n$$", "excerpt_hash": "d0c068a7d032da223ea6360c5bf3edf0b1abb75411a711cc8585ede7aa7a4b08", "heading_path": ["05 - ML Evaluation Metrics", "Classification Metrics", "Precision and Recall"], "knowledge_unit_id": "KU-bd157ce6b00dd71b", "line_end": 37, "line_start": 35, "source_file_hash": "72af1c3db6d86dc2f93167093465fbd6126cb919742ddb5484666ad31dda8a39", "source_format": "markdown", "source_id": "master-ai:03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "source_path": "03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "unit_type": "math_block", "verification_status": {"accounting": "pending", "editorial": "pending", "extraction": "machine-segmented", "semantic": "pending", "technical": "pending"}}
{"disposition": "Unaccounted", "excerpt": "$$\n\\text{Recall} = \\frac{TP}{TP + FN} \\quad \\text{(of actual positives, how many did we catch)}\n$$", "excerpt_hash": "eb5459995ac1c8358868bed0041abdf3c6defff1cef99e75f14abad2e885746d", "heading_path": ["05 - ML Evaluation Metrics", "Classification Metrics", "Precision and Recall"], "knowledge_unit_id": "KU-d8c0857557f50384", "line_end": 41, "line_start": 39, "source_file_hash": "72af1c3db6d86dc2f93167093465fbd6126cb919742ddb5484666ad31dda8a39", "source_format": "markdown", "source_id": "master-ai:03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "source_path": "03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "unit_type": "math_block", "verification_status": {"accounting": "pending", "editorial": "pending", "extraction": "machine-segmented", "semantic": "pending", "technical": "pending"}}
{"disposition": "Unaccounted", "excerpt": "Tradeoff: high precision = few false positives; high recall = few false negatives. Which matters depends on the cost of each error type.", "excerpt_hash": "17f53b8a9d148232a96e6f65e139d45a5f592e8cb142eb7e3b27c2768b5fe0a3", "heading_path": ["05 - ML Evaluation Metrics", "Classification Metrics", "Precision and Recall"], "knowledge_unit_id": "KU-c0e3727d25129255", "line_end": 43, "line_start": 43, "source_file_hash": "72af1c3db6d86dc2f93167093465fbd6126cb919742ddb5484666ad31dda8a39", "source_format": "markdown", "source_id": "master-ai:03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "source_path": "03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "unit_type": "prose", "verification_status": {"accounting": "pending", "editorial": "pending", "extraction": "machine-segmented", "semantic": "pending", "technical": "pending"}}
{"disposition": "Unaccounted", "excerpt": "- **Spam filter**: precision matters more (false positives = real email in spam folder).\n- **Cancer screening**: recall matters more (false negatives = missed cancer).", "excerpt_hash": "f4ab2f50720be37d2c83d1f282a35fa617f4ed4cc4134b2f57f8bb74d36bdc96", "heading_path": ["05 - ML Evaluation Metrics", "Classification Metrics", "Precision and Recall"], "knowledge_unit_id": "KU-0bf5c8908270a972", "line_end": 46, "line_start": 45, "source_file_hash": "72af1c3db6d86dc2f93167093465fbd6126cb919742ddb5484666ad31dda8a39", "source_format": "markdown", "source_id": "master-ai:03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "source_path": "03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "unit_type": "list", "verification_status": {"accounting": "pending", "editorial": "pending", "extraction": "machine-segmented", "semantic": "pending", "technical": "pending"}}
{"disposition": "Unaccounted", "excerpt": "$$\nF_1 = 2 \\cdot \\frac{\\text{Precision} \\cdot \\text{Recall}}{\\text{Precision} + \\text{Recall}}\n$$", "excerpt_hash": "81dd2723ee374eb1396d78dda3cd92d3c946578419649484335aeec69fc33547", "heading_path": ["05 - ML Evaluation Metrics", "Classification Metrics", "F1 Score"], "knowledge_unit_id": "KU-628ddc6b2e63a8a2", "line_end": 52, "line_start": 50, "source_file_hash": "72af1c3db6d86dc2f93167093465fbd6126cb919742ddb5484666ad31dda8a39", "source_format": "markdown", "source_id": "master-ai:03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "source_path": "03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "unit_type": "math_block", "verification_status": {"accounting": "pending", "editorial": "pending", "extraction": "machine-segmented", "semantic": "pending", "technical": "pending"}}
{"disposition": "Unaccounted", "excerpt": "The harmonic mean of precision and recall. Favors balanced precision/recall. Use **F-beta** to weight recall (beta > 1) or precision (beta < 1).", "excerpt_hash": "17e06b04bfe12bdcc6ed8a44ae19e6d3b3eb16f75f66c30237b7b436a6d7b266", "heading_path": ["05 - ML Evaluation Metrics", "Classification Metrics", "F1 Score"], "knowledge_unit_id": "KU-b109c51de90e0f55", "line_end": 54, "line_start": 54, "source_file_hash": "72af1c3db6d86dc2f93167093465fbd6126cb919742ddb5484666ad31dda8a39", "source_format": "markdown", "source_id": "master-ai:03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "source_path": "03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "unit_type": "prose", "verification_status": {"accounting": "pending", "editorial": "pending", "extraction": "machine-segmented", "semantic": "pending", "technical": "pending"}}
