{"disposition": "Unaccounted", "excerpt": "- **Macro F1**: average F1 across classes (treats all classes equally).\n- **Micro F1**: aggregates TP/FP/FN across classes then computes F1 (favors larger classes).\n- **Top-k accuracy**: fraction of examples where the true class is in the top-k predictions. Common for ImageNet-style eval (top-5).", "excerpt_hash": "ed271bf22ce523d943ab06f3e4f5b546b627d0e7a9b7527a7cd8c13ca163f5f7", "heading_path": ["05 - ML Evaluation Metrics", "Classification Metrics", "Multiclass"], "knowledge_unit_id": "KU-9a10723cb1a31a04", "line_end": 79, "line_start": 77, "source_file_hash": "72af1c3db6d86dc2f93167093465fbd6126cb919742ddb5484666ad31dda8a39", "source_format": "markdown", "source_id": "master-ai:03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "source_path": "03 - Machine Learning/Evaluation/05 - ML Evaluation Metrics.md", "unit_type": "list", "verification_status": {"accounting": "pending", "editorial": "pending", "extraction": "machine-segmented", "semantic": "pending", "technical": "pending"}}
